# Workspace hygiene

The engine copy is `C:\dev\omni-engine`. Do not create, write, or move files outside that directory. That includes Temp, AppData, the home directory, and `G:`.

- Put temporary files in `<project>/.tmp/`, for example `products/aiwake/.tmp/`.
- Put test outputs in `<project>/tests/` or `<project>/.tmp/`.
- Every `.tmp/` directory is gitignored. Do not commit one.
- Do not read, print, or extract git credentials, tokens, or `.env` values. Push with plain `git push` only.
- Keep code modular. Each product or channel keeps its own config, tools, and tests in its own folder. Do not leave loose scripts, notes, or outputs at the repository root.

An Aiwake caption check belongs in `products/aiwake/.tmp/caption-check.json`, not in `%TEMP%` and not beside `main.py`.
